			message: '#^Call to function is_subclass_of\(\) with ''Omnitrade\\\\Amazon\\\\AmazonGatewayFactory''\|''Omnitrade\\\\PayPal\\\\PayPalGatewayFactory''\|''Omnitrade\\\\Shopify\\\\ShopifyGatewayFactory''\|''Omnitrade\\\\Stripe\\\\StripeGatewayFactory''\|''Omnitrade\\\\Web\\\\WebGatewayFactory''\|''Omnitrade\\\\WooCommerce\\\\WooCommerceGatewayFactory'' and ''Omnitrade\\\\GatewayFactoryInterface'' will always evaluate to true\.$#'
